  "description": "Three accounts at two precisions. Two installment splits whose remainders do not vanish, a BHD overdraft fee on a day that later recovers, and two balances small enough that the daily accrual rounds to zero every single day - the nullification Notes.md flags as an ambiguity, made visible and asserted.",
